	text: [
		"Gas masks are a category of armor and armor attachments used to protect from various hazards present in Nuclear Tech Mod.",
		"",
		"They rarely protect from any hazards, as those are covered by filters. Although, some of them may be used to protect your eyes.",
		"",
		"Filters can be installed in most Gas Masks, and are used to add some protection to them. ",
		"",
		"There are a variety of filters with different protections for specific harazards. In the early game, you will need a filter with the capacity to protect from airborne particles for protection agaisnt coal and asbestos."
